            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lazam"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe has a lot of extra ingredients, some of which made the salad too bitter (ie. cabbage). My husband is Lebanese and I have never had Fattoush with this many ingredients. It's also missing a few key ingredients from other recipes (ie. sumac, salt, etc.) Keep it simpler - much tastier in the \"Authentic\" version! I would stick with the Authentic Lebanese Fattoush on this website.",
